WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:03.297
It was the day of the baptism.

2
00:00:03.298 --> 00:00:07.063
The king and queen waited for the guests to arrive.

3
00:00:07.064 --> 00:00:14.942
A nanny stood nearby, holding the baby.

4
00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:18.687
"What a wonderful day," the king said.

5
00:00:18.688 --> 00:00:25.564
"Our friends and family are coming to—Oh no!" He slapped his forehead.

6
00:00:25.565 --> 00:00:29.651
"There's Lady Agnes.

7
00:00:29.652 --> 00:00:35.180
I forgot to send her an invitation!"

8
00:00:35.181 --> 00:00:39.491
He waved. "Welcome, Sister."

9
00:00:39.492 --> 00:00:48.389
Agnes frowned. "You forgot to invite me, but I came anyway."

10
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:58.299
Her eyes flashed blue. "I would never miss this . . . special day."

11
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.648
The king turned to greet more guests.

12
00:01:02.649 --> 00:01:06.780
Agnes looked around for the font.

13
00:01:06.781 --> 00:01:10.475
That was where a priest would bless the baby with water.

14
00:01:10.476 --> 00:01:14.229
Agnes walked over and stood next to it.

15
00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:17.728
Soon everyone gathered around the font.

16
00:01:17.729 --> 00:01:21.746
The priest was about to dip a cup into the water.

17
00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:24.812
"Now!" Agnes thought.

18
00:01:24.813 --> 00:01:28.024
She tossed a potion into the water.

19
00:01:28.025 --> 00:01:33.729
Then she spun around three times and whispered a spell.

20
00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:37.324
Light of spirit, by my charms.

21
00:01:37.325 --> 00:01:40.520
Light of body, every part.

22
00:01:40.521 --> 00:01:43.416
Never hurt human arms.

23
00:01:43.417 --> 00:01:49.988
Just crush your parents' heart!

24
00:01:49.989 --> 00:01:55.276
The baby suddenly laughed, and Nanny let out a gasp. She

25
00:01:55.277 --> 00:02:01.599
didn't tell anyone that now Ellen felt lighter than air! ***

26
00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:05.106
At first no one realized something was wrong.

27
00:02:05.107 --> 00:02:11.313
But soon after the baptism, there was an odd event.

28
00:02:11.314 --> 00:02:14.902
Ellen flew out of Nanny's arms!

29
00:02:14.903 --> 00:02:19.814
The tiny baby kicked and laughed as she floated around the room.

30
00:02:19.815 --> 00:02:23.073
"Help!" Nanny cried.

31
00:02:23.074 --> 00:02:26.908
A servant rushed in, and Nanny pointed to the ceiling.

32
00:02:26.909 --> 00:02:32.917
"The baby is floating!" she said.

33
00:02:32.918 --> 00:02:35.923
The servant ran for a ladder.

34
00:02:35.924 --> 00:02:41.365
Nanny climbed up to fetch the baby.

35
00:02:41.366 --> 00:02:43.509
Later it happened again.

36
00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.732
This time the king was holding the baby.

37
00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:50.368
"How odd, my queen." He frowned.

38
00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:53.955
"I can't feel Ellen in my arms. It's as if—" Shwoop!

39
00:02:53.956 --> 00:02:58.519
The baby floated out of his arms.

40
00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:06.447
She laughed and danced in the air.

41
00:03:06.448 --> 00:03:09.021
"Help!" the king cried.

42
00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.725
The servant came running with the ladder.

43
00:03:11.726 --> 00:03:15.841
He climbed up and grabbed the baby with a pair of tongs.

44
00:03:15.842 --> 00:03:18.286
The king and queen turned to each other.

45
00:03:18.287 --> 00:03:23.140
The king gulped. "The princess is too light!"

46
00:03:23.141 --> 00:03:32.250
"Yes," the queen said in horror. "Her gravity is gone!"

